1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Mê, eslê xwe bîr dike?
 
Does it forget its origin?

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Na welle. Xwedê rehma xwe li bav û kalên te bike.
 
No, by God. May God have mercy on your ancestors.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Di vê dinyayê de, çi rind e.
 
It is so beautiful in this world.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Gerek însan geş bike darê.
 
A person must take care of the tree.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Eslê xwe bîr nake.
 
It doesn't forget its origin.

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Na. Welle nake.
 
No. By God, it does not.

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Eger te'kîd bikim ji we ra... yanî teqrîben derdora... gerek
ser şeş sed salî re be.
 
If I can confirm to you... meaning approximately around...
it should be over six hundred years old.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Wextê ez çûm ji... sê, teqrîben sê sal û nîvek berê ez
hatim.
 
When I went... three, approximately three and a half years
ago I came.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Apê rehma Xwedê lê be bi hev re em dertên û vîdyoyek ser
qenatê heye.
 
The late uncle and I went out together and there is a video
on the channel.

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Xwedê rehma xwe lê bike.
 
May God have mercy on him.

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
U çûkê jî hebî. Lê çû berî giya.
 
And the birds were there too. But they left before the
grass.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Kilikên tivizîk e, kenger e... yekê jê dikim, teşkîle.
 
It's tender kilik, wild artichoke... I pick some, make a
mix.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Zehterê haşîna yekê jê dikim.
 
I pick some wild thyme.

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Dembaş temaşevanên me yê hêja. Temaşevanên me yê ezîz.
 
Good day to our dear viewers. Our beloved viewers.

15
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Ji qenala we, qenala we ya Efrîn em îro dîsa li gel we ne.
 
From your channel, your Afrin channel, we are with you again
today.

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Em hatin bi vîdyoyekî xweş û bi rojeke ecer.
 
We came with a beautiful video and on a new day.

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Vîdyoyê me îro pir efo wî ye û resmîyet tê nîn e.
 
Our video today is very spontaneous and there are no
formalities in it.

18
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Berê xwe didin nav çiyê.
 
We are heading towards the mountains.

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Mabetê û bi taybet Gundê Sêviya.
 
Mabatli and specifically the village of Seviya.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Gundê Sêviya berî vê bi sal û nîvekê ez derbasî vî gundî
bibûm.
 
The village of Seviya, a year and a half ago, I passed
through this village.

21
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Yekem car ez derbasî vî gundî bibûm. Gundê Sêviya bû.
 
The first time I ever passed through a village. It was the
village of Seviya.

22
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Naha bi hev ra em ê derbasî Gundê Sêviya bin.
 
Now together we will enter the village of Seviya.

23
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Em ê piçek li wî gundî bi sekinin.
 
We will stop at that village for a bit.

24
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Bi rastî karê min jî li vir hebû. Min got çima ez û hûn bi
hev ra ne rin.
 
Actually, I also had work here. I said to myself, why don't
you and I go together.

25
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Em derbasî Gundê Sêviya jî da ne sekinin.
 
Let's pass through the village of Seviya and not just stop.

26
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Temaşevanên me yê hêja wekî hûn dibînin maşallah li bihara
Efrînê.
 
Our dear viewers, as you can see, Mashallah to the spring of
Afrin.

27
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Maşallah îsal biharê ne barî ye, xêr û bereket hatiye.
 
Mashallah, this year the spring didn't just rain, blessings
and abundance have come.

28
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Pir xweş bûye.
 
It has become very beautiful.

29
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Silav û hurmet ji we ra kê li me sêr dike, qenalê de'm
bikin.
 
Greetings and respect to you who are watching us, support
the channel.

30
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Em piçkê qenatê xwe mezin bikin û tiştine pir xweş me ji we
ra hazir kiriye.
 
Let's grow our channel a little bit and we have prepared
very nice things for you.

31
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Û meraqa min tim li ser gundê Efrînê, û tebîeta Efrînê.
 
And my curiosity is always about the villages of Afrin, and
the nature of Afrin.

32
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Ger hefteyekî ez nehatim gundan, ev tebîeta Efrînê darê
zeytûnê nebînim.
 
If I don't come to the villages for a week, and don't see
this nature of Afrin and the olive trees.

33
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Bi rastî sebra min nayê.
 
Honestly, I can't be patient.

34
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Her wisa em ê derbasî Gundê Sêviya bin wek hûn dibînin
maşallah lewha ye.
 
Likewise, we will enter the village of Seviya, as you can
see, Mashallah, it's a painting.

35
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Wek hûn dibînin tablowek e, bi xwe re tîne.
 
As you can see, it's a living portrait.

36
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Pir gundekî xweş e bi taybet.
 
It is a very beautiful village specifically.

37
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Em ê derbasî gund bin. Em ê piçek li wî gundî biseyrînin.
 
We will enter the village. We will look around the village a
bit.

38
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Em ê derbasî cem Apê Henan bin.
 
We will go to Uncle Henan.

39
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Vê sibê, em la çend çîrokan ji me re xeber de.
 
This morning, let him tell us a few stories.

40
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Çend tembiyan li me bike.
 
Let him give us a few words of advice.

41
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Ez û xortên di emrê min de, em ê giş tembiyan lê bigrin.
 
Me and the young men my age, we will all take his advice.

42
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Em ê giş çîrokên wî bibînin.
 
We will all see his stories.

43
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Çîrokên ku em li ser mezin bûne û em ê ku li ser mezin
bibin.
 
The stories that we grew up on and the ones we will grow on.

44
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Em ê derbasî Sêviya bin.
 
We will enter Seviya.

45
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Em ê nava Sêviya bigerin, silavê li wan bikin.
 
We will walk around Seviya, greet them.

46
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Wek em dibînin şivan jî naha ger wisa razî bibe.
 
As we see the shepherd now, if he agrees.

47
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Em ê derbasî cem şivanekî bin em ê çayekî xwe jî çêkin.
 
We will go to a shepherd and make ourselves some tea.

48
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Bi hev re em vîdyoyekî pir xweş, her wiha derbas kin.
 
Together we will go through a very beautiful video like
this.

49
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Her wiha tebîetê bi seyrînin û di vê vîdyoyê de inşallah em
ê derbasî nav ziyareta Sêviya jî bin.
 
Also to look at the nature and in this video, God willing,
we will also enter the Seviya shrine.

50
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Em ê piçek ziyareta wê jî bi seyrînin.
 
We will also look at its shrine for a bit.

51
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Em sêr kin sal û nîvek berî wê ev ziyaret çawa bû.
 
Let's see how this shrine was a year and a half ago.

52
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Û em sêr kin Apê Henan belkî piçek li ser ziyaretê jî me ra
xeber de.
 
And let's see, Uncle Henan might tell us a little bit about
the shrine too.

53
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Lê naha bi me ra bin em bi dilekî xweş û bi dilekî geş em
derbasî Gundê Sêviya bin.
 
But now stay with us, with a happy heart and a bright heart,
