81
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,000
Erê welle kilîk e, em hatin kilîkê zoratê bikin.
 
Yes, by God, it is kilik, we came to pick kilik.

82
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,000
Ev çi ye di destê we de ye?
 
What is this in your hand?

83
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Ev kilîkê mêst e.
 
This is yogurt kilik.

84
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Maşallah îsal bihar xweş e.
 
Mashallah, this year the spring is beautiful.

85
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Bihar xweş e welle. Xêr û bereket heye.
 
The spring is beautiful, by God. There is blessing and
abundance.

86
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Elhemdulîllah ji Xwedê re. Hezar carî.
 
Praise be to God. A thousand times.

87
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:54,000
Çend sal e wisa baran nebarîye ev xêr û av nebûye.
 
It's been a few years that it hasn't rained like this, there
hasn't been this blessing and water.

88
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Piştî heft heşt salan em dibînin maşallah bihara îsal xweş
